<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Bonn to Monaco and back by motorcycle, April 2023. Drawn after the fact (BRouter car-eco through hand-picked waypoints:
     Koblenz, Mainz, Karlsruhe, Freiburg, Basel, Bern, Kandersteg | Lötschberg car train | Goppenstein, Brig, Simplon,
     Domodossola, Novara, Turin, Cuneo, Col de Tende, Ventimiglia). Same way back. The train is not part of the track
     (four segments: out north, out south, back south, back north). Thinned to 20 m. Not a recorded track. -->
